5,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. We can't keep repeating old mistakes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll look into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract. We need to know if we have the people.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm interested in the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, as well as the journey audits on where minutes go. Let's see where time is actually lost.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to check the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes. I worry about hidden delays.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. The long-term costs are what concern me.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
